Description: closed captions and teletext subtitle extractor
 CCExtractor is a tool that extracts closed captions and teletext subtitles
 from video files and streams. It supports a wide variety of input formats
 including MPEG, H.264/AVC, H.265/HEVC, MP4, MKV, WTV, and transport streams.
 .
 Supported caption formats:
  - CEA-608 (EIA-608) - US analog closed captions
  - CEA-708 (EIA-708) - US digital closed captions
  - DVB subtitles - European digital subtitles
  - Teletext - European broadcast text system
  - ISDB - Japanese/Brazilian digital captions
 .
 Output formats include SRT, WebVTT, SAMI, transcript, and many others.
 .
 CCExtractor can also extract burned-in (hardcoded) subtitles using OCR
 when built with Tesseract and FFmpeg support.
